        <h1 class="heading-xl measure">Bilingual answering service in Arkansas for English and Spanish callers</h1>
        <p class="body-lg measure" style="margin-top:1.15rem">
          The phone rings in English, or it rings in Spanish. Somebody has to
          finish the call either way. Arkansas Automated builds a 24/7
          answering setup that answers in your business's voice, qualifies the
          caller by rules you write, and books the job onto your real calendar.
