          That is a size fact about the coverage area. It is not a count of
          bilingual callers, and we are not treating it as one.
        </p>
        <p>
          A Fayetteville office starts on the
          <a class="text-link" href="/answering-service-fayetteville-ar/">Fayetteville answering service page</a>.
          A River Valley office starts on the
          <a class="text-link" href="/answering-service-fort-smith-ar/">Fort Smith answering service page</a>.
